CommitDate: Mon Aug 10 21:47:11 2026 -0700

    fix: release registration code to active on account deletion

    DeleteAccountHard now restores any registration code consumed by the
    deleted user back to active (clearing used_by_user_id / used_at), so the
    code is reusable instead of being permanently locked by a user that no
    longer exists. Other users' codes are untouched. Covers both
    self-service account deletion and admin hard-delete, since both flow
    through DeleteAccountHard. This is a same-day new feature's cleanup hook
    appended to the steps array, not a change to upstream delete logic.

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

